<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>SAT  Kohler		 YR EPS   46.5	46-47.1	   40.4</p>
<p>SAT  Kohler		 YR DIV   16.0	15.9-16	   14.0</p>
<p>MON  FoodCorp	     YR EPS   264.7     262-267	   233.1</p>
<p>MON  FoodCorp	     YR DIV   100.5     80-121	    27.0</p>
<p>TUE  SADrug		 YR EPS   212.5     212-213	   191.4</p>
<p>TUE  SADrug		 YR DIV   69.0	68-70	     62.0</p>
<p>WED  Altron		 H1 EPS   32.5	31.7-33.1	 27.6</p>
<p>NOTE:-</p>
<p>- Foodcorp did not declare a final dividend at the end of the 1995 financial year and the 27 cents is the interim dividend in that year.</p>
<p>- Kohler's previous figures have been restated to take into account a 10-for-1 share split in February.</p>
<p>- It is Altron group policy to declare a single annual dividend at the end of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
